# Unused heavy source/media (not referenced by the site)
# The originals in Images/ are what the Images/web/*.webp files were encoded from.
# They stay on disk as the master copies, but the site never loads them, so there
# is no reason to ship ~8MB of them to the repo. Only Images/web/ is served.
Video/
Images/*.psd
Images/*.jpg
Images/*.jpeg
Images/*.png
Images/*.avif
!Images/logo.jpeg

# Agent tooling / workflow docs — not part of the website
skills/
*.skill

# Backups & temp
*.backup.md
.tmp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
